{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5780": "CORDELIA: 什么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5781": "CORDELIA: 我还活着……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5782": "CORDELIA: 这是哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5783": "BEN: 看看四周。蹲大牢了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5784": "CORDELIA: 发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5785": "NIKOLAI: 一艘火焰战舰找到了我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5786": "NIKOLAI: 他们应该扔的是震荡弹，不是燃烧弹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5787": "NIKOLAI: 挨了震荡弹，人还能活几分钟。他们就趁这段时间治好伤，把人抓来当俘虏。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5788": "JEROME: 他们的确给我们治疗过，我感觉得到，而且治得很彻底。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5789": "NIKOLAI: 没看见齐卡隆，可我还是听得懂你们……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5790": "AGATA: 为什么把我们关在一起？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5791": "AGATA: 不是应该分开审问吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5792": "CORDELIA: 如果这些牢房专门关押法师，想必处处都布着防护法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5793": "CORDELIA: 这些法术里，很可能就有用来偷听我们谈话的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5794": "NIKOLAI: 很快，他们就会用更直接的办法让我们开口。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5795": "JUNA: 亚历。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5796": "JUNA: 亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5797": "ALEXANDRA: 我不行……不行……不行……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5798": "JUNA: 等等，慢慢呼吸。他们应该不会理我们两个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5799": "JUNA: 我们对他们没威胁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5800": "ALEXANDRA: 我不想待在这里。不想待在这里。不想待在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5801": "JUNA: 亚历，听我说。呼吸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5802": "ALEXANDRA: 我不该在这里！不该在这里！不该在这里！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5803": "ALEXANDRA: 我不该在这里！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5804": "ALEXANDRA: 什……什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5805": "ALEXANDRA: 好……冷。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palacePrison-5806": "ALEXANDRA: 大家呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-coldPalace-5807": "ALEXANDRA: 等等……我回到……自己的世界了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-coldPalace-5808": "ALEXANDRA: 那我就能回家了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5809": "ALEXANDRA: 啊！冷死了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5810": "ALEXANDRA: 好冷……从没这么……得找个地方……暖和一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5811": "ALEXANDRA: 还是好冷……已经感觉不到……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5812": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5813": "ALEXANDRA: 等、等等！求你别告诉别人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5814": "ALEXANDRA: 我跟那些人不是一伙的！我只想回家！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5815": "ZIKARON: ……镇定……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5816": "ALEXANDRA: 哦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5817": "ALEXANDRA: 你怎么出来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5818": "ZIKARON: ……掩护……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5819": "ALEXANDRA: 这，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5820": "ALEXANDRA: 希望他们看不穿，也别来跟我说话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-enterBlizzard-5821": "ALEXANDRA: （找些暖和衣服吧。万一又回到自己的世界……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-blizzardNoGo-5822": "ALEXANDRA: 不能再出去了……绝对不行……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5823": "OFFICER: 我也不想坐那儿听！可总得派个人去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5824": "OFFICER: 你，少尉，叫什么名字？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5825": "ALEXANDRA: 我？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5826": "OFFICER: 对，就是你，叫什么？怎么没见过你？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5827": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……欣。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5828": "OFFICER: 欣克尔？好，欣克尔，你去参加维尔特博士的会议。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5829": "OFFICER: 做好记录，伯尼克上校忙，没空去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5830": "ALEXANDRA: 哦……呃，好，在哪、在哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5831": "LIEUTENANT: 连会议室在哪儿都不知道？真够嫩的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5832": "LIEUTENANT: 肯定是谁家的侄子……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5833": "LIEUTENANT: 就拐角那边，人多的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-ltMeeting-5834": "OFFICER: （这还用问……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5835": "COLONEL: 怎么，伯尼克派你来做记录？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5836": "ALEXANDRA: 呃，是……长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5837": "COLONEL: 好，人齐了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5838": "COLONEL: 出了点问题，舰队受阻，对卢斯基亚的入侵也随之停在阿瓦尔河东北一带。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5839": "COLONEL: 卢斯基亚人炸毁了自己的地脉，一千英里内都没有魔力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5840": "COLONEL: 请维尔特博士来，是为我们介绍一种新办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5841": "WIRTH: 总理想知道，从人体抽取魔力的研究，能否解决这个问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5842": "WIRTH: 受电池容量限制，火焰战舰无法从地脉补充魔力时，最远只能飞六百英里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5843": "WIRTH: 但以同等重量计算，人体蕴藏的魔力远远多于任何电池。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5844": "WIRTH: 如果能把抽取机模块化，只需在船上处理掉囚犯，就能延长航程。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5845": "ALEXANDRA: （他们每次开会都谈这种事吗……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5846": "LIEUTENANT: T4 计划这帮人，真是越说越自我陶醉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5847": "LIEUTENANT: 这种会就该让人喝啤酒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5848": "ALEXANDRA: （也许他们知道，哪里有暖和衣服？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5849": "ALEXANDRA: 您好，呃……上校把冬衣落在这附近了，他，呃……比较怕冷。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5850": "LIEUTENANT: 嘿，这样吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5851": "LIEUTENANT: 试试这条围巾够不够暖。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5852": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……哇，真暖，能让我拿走吗？我是说，拿给上校。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5853": "LIEUTENANT: 呵，他恐怕不会喜欢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5854": "ALEXANDRA: 为什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5855": "LIEUTENANT: 这是人发织的，囚犯进劳役营时，头发都会被剪下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5856": "ALEXANDRA: 啊！快拿开！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5857": "ALEXANDRA: 天啊……又回到这里了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-wirthMeeting-5858": "ALEXANDRA: 也许这边能找到什么穿的……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5859": "ALEXANDRA: 呃，有人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5860": "GIRL: 妈妈，她是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5861": "WOMAN: 是在暴风雪里抓来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5863": "BARBARIAN: 不许离开房间！你知道！现在要受罚！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5864": "WOMAN: 怎么会……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5865": "????: 等等，你从东南方来，却会说里恩语？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5866": "ALEXANDRA: 不是，我从塞伦来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5867": "????: 凭你的本事……能把我们救出去……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5868": "????: 我叫露易丝，也来自塞伦！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5869": "ALEXANDRA: 我叫亚历珊德拉，可这里到底是怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5870": "LOUISE: 那些野蛮人……他们逼我们做很多事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5871": "LOUISE: 可我们听见他们说，还给我准备了什么“特别的”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5872": "LOUISE: 要是比他们平时做的还可怕……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5874": "LOUISE: 得走了！现在就走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-meetSlaves-5875": "ALEXANDRA: 好、好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseNotThatWay-5876": "LOUISE: 别走那边！他们来抓我们了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-definitelyNotThatWay-5877": "ALEXANDRA: 那边绝对不行！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-noPalaceDown-5878": "LOUISE: 从那里走会被抓，不过这层应该还有路能绕过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5879": "ALEXANDRA: 天、天啊……冷得直、直发抖。我可能……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5880": "LOUISE: 撑一下，在这里待了这么久，总算学了些办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5881": "ALEXANDRA: 谢、谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5882": "LOUISE: 尽量靠近些，暖和一下，我们不能待太久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5883": "LOUISE: 他们以前对付过你这样的人，得趁追来之前走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5884": "ALEXANDRA: 你怎么会来到这么远的地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5885": "LOUISE: 我父亲是商人，跟东南边的野蛮人城镇做生意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5886": "LOUISE: 后来有一次，他去了就没再回家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5887": "LOUISE: 我和妈妈就出门去找他，我还没出生的时候，妈妈也跟着他走过这条商路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5888": "LOUISE: 找到才知道，他已经在那座镇子里又成了一个家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5889": "LOUISE: 回家途中，我们的商队遭到了伏击，那已经是……三年？还是四年前的事了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5890": "LOUISE: 困在这里，日子过了多久都记不清了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5891": "ALEXANDRA: 我好了，咱们离开这里吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5892": "LOUISE: 得给你找些兽皮，像我身上这些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5893": "LOUISE: 也许能从卡米耶那里拿些，她多得用不完。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-louiseFire-5894": "LOUISE: 她的房间在这边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alex2fColdWarp-5895": "ALEXANDRA: 怎么都暖、暖和不起来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alex2fColdWarp-5896": "LOUISE: 马上就到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alex2fColdWarp-5897": "ALEXANDRA: 脚、脚又开始麻了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alex2fColdWarp-5899": "ALEXANDRA: 不、不行！别在这时候！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alex2fColdWarp-5900": "LOUISE: 怎么了？亚历珊德拉！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alex2fColdWarp-5901": "ALEXANDRA: 我……你怎么知道我会在哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alex2fColdWarp-5902": "ZIKARON: ……继续……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alex2fColdWarp-5903": "ALEXANDRA: （到底怎么才能回到另一边……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5904": "ALEXANDRA: （得再慌起来，马上。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5905": "CAPTAIN: 冯·罗尔带走了一半舰队。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5906": "LIEUTENANT: 去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5907": "CAPTAIN: 往西，具体去干什么，我不知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5908": "ALEXANDRA: 我是外国间谍！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5909": "CAPTAIN: 你说什么，少尉？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5910": "ALEXANDRA: 我要跟管事的将军打一架！听见没有？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5911": "LIEUTENANT: 这是演习？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5912": "CAPTAIN: 少尉，你当值喝醉了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5913": "ALEXANDRA: 那个……呃，叫什么……总理在哪里？我要干掉他！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5914": "CAPTAIN: 把这小丑弄出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5915": "ALEXANDRA: （对……来抓我啊。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5916": "ALEXANDRA: 没错！谁，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5917": "ALEXANDRA: 还有谁要打！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5918": "ALEXANDRA: （好……来了！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexForcedPanic-5919": "ALEXANDRA: 露易丝？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5920": "????: 有人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5921": "????: 你不该到这里来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5922": "ALEXANDRA: 你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5923": "????: 我是卡米耶·普兰博士，他们应该说过不许打扰我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5924": "ALEXANDRA: 为什么你有这么多东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5925": "CAMILLE: 因为我不是他们的奴隶，而是研究这个部落的民族学家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5926": "CAMILLE: 不用问，我和他们订过随行的约定，他们非常看重以誓言立下的契约。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5927": "ALEXANDRA: 他们把露易丝带去哪儿了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5928": "CAMILLE: 你最好别知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5929": "ALEXANDRA: 告诉我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5930": "CAMILLE: 他们要把她当作巫女烧死献祭，求神灵停止暴风雪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5931": "CAMILLE: 仪式还包括吃掉她的遗体，那大概才是真正的原因，毕竟粮食不够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5932": "ALEXANDRA: 什么！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5933": "ALEXANDRA: 你知道自己在说什么吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5934": "CAMILLE: 他们的世界就是这样，奴役和献祭也不过是其中的一部分，你和我都改变不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5935": "ALEXANDRA: 他们把她带去哪儿了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5936": "CAMILLE: 拐角那间中央大厅。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-camilleScene-5937": "CAMILLE: 你要干涉，就会落得同样的下场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5938": "ALEXANDRA: （来了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5939": "LOUISE: 亚历珊德拉？是你吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5940": "ALEXANDRA: 放开她！这样没用！这个世界根本没有魔法！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5941": "ALEXANDRA: 不！等等！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5942": "LOUISE: 怎么回事！？亚历珊德拉！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5944": "ALEXANDRA: 对、对不起，我不是故意到这里来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5945": "????: 那是……里恩语？你说里恩语？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5946": "????: 很美的语言，我很久没听人说了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5947": "????: 请坐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5948": "URALT: 没人会来打扰，我不需要保护。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5949": "ALEXANDRA: 你就是……这里管事的人？那个……总理？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5950": "URALT: 正是，你想必就是那个会消失的少尉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5951": "ALEXANDRA: 是你……命令军队杀死营地里那些人的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5952": "URALT: 我下过许多命令。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5953": "ALEXANDRA: 为什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5954": "URALT: 果然还是个孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5955": "URALT: 为什么必须严酷地治理世界？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5956": "URALT: 社会必须由最优秀的人统治，不是按某种随意标准评出来的好人，而是拥有绝对德性的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5957": "URALT: 血统、民族[oxfordComma /]与人格皆优越的人，有意志改变历史的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5958": "URALT: 当今，世上的杂种民族正耗尽一切资源。贫穷匮乏之人聚成了嚎叫的暴民。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5959": "URALT: 他们自私的目标若得逞，就只剩混乱……一个再无人类的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5960": "URALT: 为了捍卫文明本身，我所推动的一切，都是可以允许的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5961": "ALEXANDRA: 文明又有什么意义……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5962": "ALEXANDRA: ……如果你只是用它，更快地牺牲更多人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5963": "URALT: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5964": "ALEXANDRA: 你们这种人，都一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5965": "URALT: 谁派你来的？勒德尼耶？这些年，他一直在暗中谋划对付我？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5966": "ALEXANDRA: （快啊……吓我回另一边去……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5967": "URALT: 把你撕开，就知道他在里面藏了什么惊喜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5968": "URALT: 哦呵呵！这次不行了，姑娘。你现在归我了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5969": "URALT: 那老蠢货真以为，凭一枚棋子就能来攻击——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5970": "ALEXANDRA: 齐……齐卡隆？怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5971": "ALEXANDRA: 你刚才做了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5972": "MAIMUN: 这些，是遭乌拉尔特总理残害的人们的记忆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5973": "MAIMUN: 齐卡隆的主要使命之一，便是让他们正式控诉乌拉尔特的罪行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5974": "MAIMUN: 但乌拉尔特是极强大的法师，很快就能挣脱这道法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5975": "MAIMUN: 你必须带齐卡隆一起逃走，他还有最后一项使命尚未完成，而履行它的时刻已经近了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5976": "MAIMUN: 快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5977": "ALEXANDRA: 嘿！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5978": "SECRETARY: 你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5979": "ALEXANDRA: 出了点，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5980": "ALEXANDRA: 总理出事了！我去找人帮忙！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAssault-5981": "ALEXANDRA: （快到了，稳住！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5982": "ALEXANDRA: 快去帮忙！总理出事了！他像是失了神！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5983": "OFFICER: 少尉，这里是禁区。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5984": "ALEXANDRA: 放心，我们这就走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5985": "ALEXANDRA: 所有人一起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5986": "ALEXANDRA: 钥匙拿到了！大家准备好！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5987": "CORDELIA: 发生了什么？你去哪儿了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5988": "ALEXANDRA: 说来话长，不过这里马上就要乱套了，我们现在就得走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5989": "NIKOLAI: 没有装备，走不了多远。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5990": "ALEXANDRA: 我已经全拿回来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5991": "ALEXANDRA: 可我没开玩笑，这里真的马上要乱套了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexPalaceDistraction-5992": "NIKOLAI: 好，别散开，盯紧他们的军官，速度和出其不意是我们最大的优势。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-coldWarning1-5993": "LOUISE: 这里小心，风会从屋顶的洞里灌进来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-coldWarning1-5994": "LOUISE: 在外面冻得太久，可能会昏过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palaceSurrounded-5995": "NIKOLAI: 楼肯定被包围了，找条不那么显眼的路出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palaceSurrounded-5996": "不是好主意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-palaceRestricted-5997": "SOLDIER: 长官，这里是禁区，得先向上面请示。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-barricaded1-5998": "NIKOLAI: 路障。可能还藏着陷阱。另找条路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-barricaded2-5999": "NIKOLAI: 路障。可能还藏着陷阱。另找条路。"
}
